# Bruno collections are plain text, so anything written into a .bru file reaches
# the repository. Keep credentials out of this folder.

# Values for the command line runner. Each developer copies .env.example to .env
# and fills it in. Neither .env nor a version of it is ever committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# A personal copy of an environment, for example mine.local.bru
*.local.bru

# Node dependencies, if the CLI is ever installed into this folder
node_modules/